        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>手写笔记 — 教师观与学生观</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f4f4f2;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfdfb;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    padding: 40px 0 20px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .main {\n    width: 430px;\n    margin-left: 20px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .blue { color: #1a3fbf; }\n  .black { color: #111; }\n  .i1 { margin-left: 40px; }\n  .i2 { margin-left: 70px; }\n  .i3 { margin-left: 95px; }\n  .i4 { margin-left: 120px; }\n  .i5 { margin-left: 145px; }\n  .heading { margin-left: 25px; }\n  .tri { font-size: 12px; }\n  .side {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 100%;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #444;\n    border-left: 1px solid #ddd;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #fafaf8;\n  }\n  .side .illeg { color: #888; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .pen {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 46px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 240px;\n    transform: rotate(8deg);\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    padding-top: 90px;\n  }\n  .fold {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 4px;\n    left: 120px;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 26px;\n  }\n  .note-small { font-size: 11px; }\n  .ghost {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 90px;\n    width: 90px;\n    color: #cfcfcf;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    transform: rotate(-2deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"fold placeholder\">[Photo: 纸张褶皱阴影, 顶部居中]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"ghost\">[illegible]<br>[illegible]<br>[illegible]<br>[illegible]<br>[illegible]<br>[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"heading black\">4. 教师观（教师的要求）:</div>\n\n    <div class=\"i1 black\">角色: 教师是学生学习的促进者</div>\n    <div class=\"i2 black\">教育教学的研究者.（复杂性）</div>\n    <div class=\"i2 black\">课程的开发者和建设者</div>\n    <div class=\"i2 blue\">开发者 无→有　建设者 有→优.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"i1 black\">社区型开放教师:</div>\n\n    <div class=\"i2 black\">行为: 尊重（对问题的坚持和引导）赞美（表扬）</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">帮助引导（是学生学习的促进者引导者.）</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">自我反思.</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">合作.</div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-left:170px; font-size:12px;\" class=\"blue\">身心</div>\n\n    <div class=\"black\" style=\"margin-left:8px;\">5. 学生观 <span class=\"tri\">△</span> 学生是发展中的人。① 学生的发展是有规律的.</div>\n    <div class=\"i1 blue\">我们要按照学生的身心发展规律进行教育.</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">② 学生是有巨大的发展潜能的.</div>\n    <div class=\"i1 blue\">我们要有信心, 每个学生都会有所进步</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">③ 学生是发展过程中的人（容错）</div>\n    <div class=\"i1 blue\">学生的身心发展尚未发展成熟, 重点评讲学生犯错.</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 black\">④ 学生的发展是全面的发展.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"i1 black\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\"><span class=\"tri\">△</span> 学生是独特的人。① 与机器人比 → 有情绪、思想.</div>\n    <div class=\"i3 blue\">学生是完整的人</div>\n    <div class=\"i4 black\">② 与其他人比 → 学生有自己的独特性</div>\n    <div class=\"i4 black\">③ 与成人比 → 学生之间有巨大的差异</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side\">\n    例 5<br>\n    <span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span><br>\n    学 4<br>\n    <span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span><br>\n    <span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span><br>\n    完 3<br>\n    (一般<br>\n    <span class=\"illeg\">[